#: crates/ui-egui/src/whats_new.rs
msgid "A native iPhone app. On iPhone Duo it's the whole modeler: the front screen holds your projects and opening it up takes you into the model, where fingers move the view and a stylus draws and picks. On other iPhones projects open to view: turn them, change the display, take a screenshot or export. Sideload it onto your own phone (docs/ios.md)."
